Python Activity

## What I learned

I started learning Python through CS50P Week 0. I learned how to use variables, take input from the user and print output. I also tried a simple program using numbers.

## My first program

```python
name = input("Enter your name: ")
track = input("Enter your VLSI track: ")

print("Hello", name)
print("My track is", track)
```

## Output

```text
Enter your name: Vinay
Enter your VLSI track: Physical Design
Hello Vinay
My track is Physical Design
```

## My second program

```python
a = 10
b = 20

print("Sum =", a + b)
```

Output:

```text
Sum = 30
```

## My experience

I found Python easy to start with. I understood how to store values in variables, take input and display the result. I need more practice with Python, and I want to learn how to use it for simple automation tasks related to Physical Design.
